[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2345.91, "timestamp": "00:39:05", "text": "我覺得蘑菇比較容易處理。  這是什麼？哦，蘑菇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2347.47, "timestamp": "00:39:07", "text": "我們哦，是的。我弄到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2352.79, "timestamp": "00:39:12", "text": "一台爐灶。我們需要一台炊具，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2355.91, "timestamp": "00:39:15", "text": "呃，如果你還需要一台，我們可以升級"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2361.51, "timestamp": "00:39:21", "text": "。我們可以升級它嗎？是的，我們可以升級它，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2365.99, "timestamp": "00:39:25", "text": "而不用再安裝新的。  升級後速度"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2393.99, "timestamp": "00:39:53", "text": "。這個要60美元。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2398.349, "timestamp": "00:39:58", "text": "好吧，沒事了。"}]